    "updatedAt": "2026-10-21",
    "content": "/* HackersShikkhok Unified Admin Settings Panel */\n.hs-admin-shell {\n    max-width: 1180px;\n    margin: 20px 20px 40px 0;\n    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif;\n}\n.hs-admin-hero {\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #050b14 0%, #0b1320 65%, #111827 100%);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 245, 212, 0.35);\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    padding: 24px 28px;\n    color: #e2e8f0;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 20px;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);\n}\n.hs-admin-hero h1 {\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    margin: 0 0 6px 0;\n}\n.hs-admin-hero p {\n    color: #94a3b8;\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: 13px;\n}\n.hs-admin-badge {\n    background: rgba(0, 245, 212, 0.14);\n    color: #00f5d4;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 245, 212, 0.4);\n    padding: 6px 14px;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n}\n.hs-admin-tabs {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 8px;\n    margin-bottom: 18px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1;\n    padding-bottom: 12px;\n}\n.hs-admin-tab {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 6px;\n    padding: 9px 15px;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    color: #334155;\n    border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;\n    transition: all 0.15s ease;\n}\n.hs-admin-tab:hover {\n    border-color: #0ea5e9;\n    color: #0f172a;\n}\n.hs-admin-tab.is-active {\n    background: #0b1320;\n    color: #00f5d4;\n    border-color: #00f5d4;\n}\n.hs-admin-card {\n    background: #ffffff;\n    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;\n    border-radius: 14px;\n    padding: 24px;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n    box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);\n}\n.hs-admin-card h2 {\n    margin-top: 0;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    color: #0f172a;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9;\n    padding-bottom: 10px;\n}\n.hs-toggle-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(290px, 1fr));\n    gap: 14px;\n    margin-top: 14px;\n}\n.hs-toggle-item {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 12px;\n    padding: 14px;\n    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    background: #f8fafc;\n}\n.hs-toggle-item label {\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #0f172a;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    display: block;\n    margin-bottom: 3px;\n}\n.hs-toggle-item small {\n    color: #64748b;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    display: block;\n}\n.hs-field-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(320px, 1fr));\n    gap: 18px;\n}\n.hs-field-box label {\n    display: block;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #0f172a;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n}\n.hs-field-box input[type=\"text\"],\n.hs-field-box input[type=\"password\"],\n.hs-field-box input[type=\"number\"],\n.hs-field-box input[type=\"color\"],\n.hs-field-box select {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 100%;\n    padding: 8px 12px;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;\n}\n.hs-field-box small {\n    display: block;\n    color: #64748b;\n    margin-top: 4px;\n    font-size: 11px;\n}\n.hs-danger-zone {\n    background: #fff1f2;\n    border: 1px solid #fecdd3;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    padding: 14px 18px;\n    margin-bottom: 18px;\n}\n"
